  I use by objects to store complex objects that have fixed dimensions. By
objects are very flexible because you can select any data you want using
the indices. They also work in at least some functions that manipulate
dimensional data, like apply. I generally create a by object and then
populate wit with the data that I want to store in it in a separate
operation.
