  Out of workspace.
  > fisher.test(m, workspace = 2e6)
  Error in fisher.test(m, workspace = 2e+06) : 
          FEXACT error 40.
  Out of workspace.
  > fisher.test(m, workspace = 8e6)

          Fisher's Exact Test for Count Data

  data:  m 
  p-value = 0.003819
  alternative hypothesis: true odds ratio is not equal to 1 
  95 percent confidence interval:
    1.609050 11.832354 
  sample estimates:
  odds ratio 
    4.999983 

  > 

I.e. it "works" when you provide enough "workspace".

